
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Practice Path</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #0f172a;
      color: #f1f5f9;
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .tag {
      color: #38bdf8;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .intro {
      color: #94a3b8;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .card {
      background: #1e293b;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      border: 1px solid #334155;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 19px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .muted {
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    button {
      background: #38bdf8;
      color: #0f172a;
      border: none;
      padding: 14px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-weight: bold;
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 16px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .steps {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 15px;
    }

    .step {
      background: #334155;
      padding: 10px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    footer {
      color: #64748b;
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 30px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="container">

    <p class="tag">LEARN • PRACTICE • IMPROVE</p>

    <h1>Practice Path</h1>

    <p class="intro">
      Don't just watch tutorials.
      Turn what you learn into real skills.
    </p>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Your Learning Journey</h2>
      <p class="muted">
        Start learning, experiment with code,
        test your understanding and build confidence.
      </p>

      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">01 Learn</div>
        <div class="step">02 Predict</div>
        <div class="step">03 Run</div>
        <div class="step">04 Change</div>
        <div class="step">05 Explain</div>
        <div class="step">06 Revisit</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Start Practicing</h2>
      <p class="muted">
        Your learning journey begins with
        small experiments and practical challenges.
      </p>

      <button onclick="startLearning()">
        Start Learning
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Your Progress</h2>
      <p class="muted">
        Completed checkpoints: 0
      </p>
      <p class="muted">
        Your progress tracker is coming soon.
      </p>
    </div>

    <footer>
      Practice Path · Learn by doing
    </footer>

  </div>

  <script>
    function startLearning() {
      alert("Your learning journey is about to begin!");
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
